    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Rieet Kuɔth ti bëë kɛ gatdɛ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni wal ci Kuoth ruac kä ti nyin ŋuan kɛ gua̱ndɔɔŋnikɔn kɛ thuk göökni, kɛ dup ti gööl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛn ni̱ni ti jɔak ti thia̱k ti, cɛ ruac kɛ kɔn kɛ Gat, min cɛ kuany kɛ ɣöö bɛ nyin wec muɔ̱ɔ̱n diaal guäl, kä ca ɣɔw cak kɛ jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jɛn min nyoth buay Kuɔth, kä ɛ jɛn cät Kuɔth pa̱ny, kääpɛ ɣɔw kɛɛliw kɛ rietdɛ min buɔ̱m. Mëë cɛ dueer thuk kɛ wuɔ̱c, cuɛ nyuur cuëëc Kua̱r in di̱t ni jɛn nhial.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Di̱t Gatdä Kuɔth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn gat cu di̱t ni jɛn kä ja̱a̱k, kɛ ɣöö ciöt in ca ka̱m jɛ di̱t ni jɛn kä ciöötkiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä thilɛ jääk ci Kuoth ɛ kɔŋ jiök ɔ i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
